 Over de functie 
Are you looking for a fun position as a logistics employee in a cozy family business? Would you like to work in an environment where a good working atmosphere and fun are key? Then this job in Elst is for you! 
As a logistics employee you are an important link within our logistical process. Your responsibilities include: 
· Collecting orders based on packing slips; 
· Carefully packaging and packing various products; 
· Performing quality checks on various cloths; 
· Moving materials with an EPT. 
The working hours are Monday to Friday from 8:00 to 17:00. 
Do you see yourself working as a logistics employee in this team? Do not hesitate and apply immediately! 
 Jouw nieuwe werkplek 
You will be working for a company in Elst, which is a leading player in confection for the sunshades and -screens industry. The organization is known for its informal and friendly working atmosphere. 
The workplace is easily accessible from major cities such as Nijmegen and Arnhem, and is a short walk from the train station in Elst. 
 Dit bieden wij jou 
· A salary of between €2600,- to €2800,- per month (based on 40 hours per week); 
· 25 vacation days per year; 
· 8% vacation pay; 
· Pension accrual from day one; 
· Attractive working hours in day shift; 
· Training and advancement opportunities within the company; 
· Free work shoes through Westerduin. 
 Dit vragen wij van jou 
· You have good command of the English language; 
· You are physically fit and can work well in a team; 
· Experience with an EPT is a plus. 
Sandro Salami 
